---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Halloween Fest — Fotografía de Evento · Ascndr"
  description="Cobertura fotográfica profesional de la 3ª edición de Halloween Fest, Los Villares (Jaén). Shooting desde dentro del evento por fotógrafos @alvarojimenez7 y @bydorian__, coordinado por Ascndr."
  canonical="https://ascndrworld.com/trabajos/fotografia/halloweenfest-fotografia"
>

<style is:global>
  @import "../../../styles/global.css";
  body { background: #111; margin: 0; }
  .pp { background: #111; color: #f0ece6; min-height: 100vh; font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif; }
  .pp-nav { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16px 32px; background: rgba(17,17,17,0.97); border-bottom: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e; transition: transform .35s ease; }
  .pp-nav.hidden { transform: translateY(-100%); }
  .pp-nav a { color: #555; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; }
  .pp-nav a:hover { color: #f0ece6; }
  .pp-nav-logo img { height: 56px; width: auto; display: block; }
  .pp-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 80px 32px 24px; border-bottom: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e; }
  .pp-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: .06em; color: #f0ece6; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .pp-title em { color: #555; font-style: normal; }
  .pp-credits { font-size: 10px; color: #444; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .pp-meta { display: flex; border-bottom: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e; }
  .pp-meta-item { flex: 1; padding: 18px 32px; border-right: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e; }
  .pp-meta-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .pp-meta-label { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #444; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .pp-meta-value { font-size: 12px; color: #f0ece6; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .02em; }
  .pp-desc { padding: 36px 32px 40px; border-bottom: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e; max-width: 720px; }
  .pp-desc p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; color: #888; margin: 0; }
  .pp-gallery { padding: 3px; }
  .pp-gallery-wide { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .pp-gallery-wide img { width: 100%; height: 70vh; min-height: 300px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .pp-gallery-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 3px; }
  .pp-gallery-grid img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: filter .3s; }
  .pp-gallery-grid img:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }
  .pp-cta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 32px; border-top: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e; margin-top: 3px; }
  .pp-cta-text { font-size: 11px; color: #444; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .pp-cta-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #141414; border: 0.5px solid #2a2a2a; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 22px; color: #f0ece6; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif; transition: border-color .2s; }
  .pp-cta-btn:hover { border-color: #c8753a; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pp-nav { padding: 14px 20px; }
    .pp-header { padding: 72px 20px 20px; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; }
    .pp-meta { flex-direction: column; }
    .pp-meta-item { border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e; padding: 14px 20px; }
    .pp-meta-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .pp-desc { padding: 28px 20px; }
    .pp-gallery { padding: 2px; }
    .pp-gallery-wide img { height: 50vw; min-height: 200px; }
    .pp-gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2px; }
    .pp-gallery-wide { margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .pp-cta { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 24px 20px; }
  }
</style>

<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{`
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CreativeWork",
  "name": "Halloween Fest — Fotografía de Evento",
  "description": "Cobertura fotográfica profesional de la 3ª edición de Halloween Fest en Los Villares (Jaén) desde dentro del evento.",
  "creator": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Ascndr", "url": "https://ascndrworld.com" },
  "url": "https://ascndrworld.com/trabajos/fotografia/halloweenfest-fotografia",
  "image": "https://ascndrworld.com/images/halloween-fest/portada-halloween3.jpg",
  "keywords": ["fotografía", "cobertura evento", "shooting", "Halloween", "Los Villares", "Jaén"],
  "locationCreated": { "@type": "Place", "name": "Los Villares, Jaén, España" },
  "dateCreated": "2025",
  "genre": "Fotografía · Evento"
}
`}</script>

<div class="pp">
  <nav class="pp-nav">
    <a href="/trabajos">← Trabajos</a>
    <a href="/" class="pp-nav-logo"><img src="/ascndr-logo.png" alt="Ascndr"/></a>
    <a href="/">Contacto</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="pp-header">
    <span class="pp-title">Halloween Fest <em>· Desde dentro</em></span>
  </div>

  <div class="pp-meta">
    <div class="pp-meta-item">
      <div class="pp-meta-label">Categoría</div>
      <div class="pp-meta-value">Fotografía · Evento</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-meta-item">
      <div class="pp-meta-label">Año</div>
      <div class="pp-meta-value">MMXXV</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-meta-item">
      <div class="pp-meta-label">Cliente</div>
      <div class="pp-meta-value">Halloween Fest · Los Villares (Jaén)</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pp-desc">
    <p>Cobertura fotográfica profesional de la tercera edición de Halloween Fest en Los Villares (Jaén). Shooting desde dentro del evento por @alvarojimenez7 y @bydorian__, coordinado por Ascndr.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pp-gallery">
    <div class="pp-gallery-wide">
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/portada-halloween3.jpg" alt="Halloween Fest 3ª edición Los Villares Jaén — Fotografía de evento Ascndr" fetchpriority="high"/>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-gallery-grid">
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-06.jpg" alt="DJ vinilo Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén — cobertura fotográfica" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-03.jpg" alt="Escenario luces azules Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-04.jpg" alt="Pista de baile Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén — Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-08.jpg" alt="DJ zombie Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén — fotografía evento" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-02.jpg" alt="Escenario luces amarillas Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-10.jpg" alt="Asistentes disfrazados Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-11.jpg" alt="Disfraces Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén — Ascndr fotografía" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-07.jpg" alt="DJ Pioneer Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-09.jpg" alt="Artista en escenario Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-12.jpg" alt="Staff Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén — fotografía Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-13.jpg" alt="Equipo Halloween Fest Los Villares Jaén — Ascndr estudio creativo" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-01.jpg" alt="Escenario Halloween Fest 3ª edición Los Villares Jaén — Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pp-cta">
    <span class="pp-cta-text">¿Tienes un proyecto similar?</span>
    <a href="/" class="pp-cta-btn">Hablemos →</a>
  </div>
</div>

<script is:inline>
(function(){
  var nav = document.querySelector(".pp-nav");
  var last = 0;
  window.addEventListener("scroll", function(){
    var cur = window.scrollY;
    if(cur <= 10){ nav.classList.remove("hidden"); }
    else if(cur > last){ nav.classList.add("hidden"); }
    else{ nav.classList.remove("hidden"); }
    last = cur;
  }, {passive:true});
})();
</script>

</Layout>
